For a C CPU/FPGA interface cpu_serial.c must be compiled for the Zynq ARM CPU
and linked with the application program. It might be compiled by an ARM
cross-compiler or compiled on the Zyn1 ARM CPU itself.

For a Python3 interface fpga.py must be imported into the application
program. fpga_py_extension must have been added to the Python3 library
by running the mk_setup script on the Zynq ARM CPU.
